# API-only setup, settings route (#86735)
// "Setup without config.yml" in sidecar.openapi.yaml, step 3 through the settings instead of POST /current.
// POST /api/database and its sync are not in the specs, so they are not steps. The two settings operations
// are x-status: hardening, so this flow only passes in a view that includes hardening.
mbcode -> parent: getWorkspaceConfig
mbcode -> sidecar: setDatabaseWorkspaceSchema <- {settings.database-workspace-schema}
mbcode -> sidecar: setWorkspacesEnabled <- {value}
mbcode -> sidecar: getCurrentWorkspace {data.databases.database_id, data.databases.schema}
